% The Crossing (ability catalogue)
%
% A gate opens on a hall. Past the hall, a crypt whose back wall has fallen
% into the abyss, and the brink of the same abyss. Nothing dies in general
% here: each enemy has its own weakness, and the team has to find it.
%
%   sentry   a heavy machine behind a barrier, at the brink. It cannot be
%            moved. Break the barrier (any hostile tag takes it), soak it,
%            and a jolt short-circuits it - or a frost seizes its joints.
%   bramble  a wooden thing hiding in the crypt's shadows. It cannot be aimed
%            at until light finds it; then fire takes it - or a push sends
%            it through the broken wall.
%   brute    a boss in armour at the brink. No hard control holds it, and
%            the armour keeps it from being moved: sunder the armour, and
%            someone else sends it over the edge.
%
% The Mage throws flashbangs and calls rain; the Warden sunders, bashes and
% taunts. The player picks two skills from the catalogue.
%
% Hypothesis (design.md): several kits clear it by different routes, no
% pick is mandatory, and every plan needs at least two companions.

% === Regions ===
region(gate).
region(hall).
region(crypt).
region(brink).
region(abyss).
connected(gate, hall).
connected(hall, gate).
connected(hall, crypt).
connected(crypt, hall).
connected(hall, brink).
connected(brink, hall).
lineOfSight(gate, hall).
lineOfSight(gate, brink).
lineOfSight(hall, crypt).
lineOfSight(hall, brink).

% Push lines: whatever stands at the brink, or in the crypt, goes over.
beyond(hall, brink, abyss).
beyond(gate, brink, abyss).
beyond(brink, brink, abyss).
beyond(hall, crypt, abyss).
beyond(crypt, crypt, abyss).

% === Zones ===
onEnter(crypt, shadows).
onEnter(abyss, chasm).

% === Companions ===
role(player, player).
role(mage, companion).
role(warden, companion).
at(player, gate).
at(mage, gate).
at(warden, gate).
mana(player, 4).
knows(mage, flashbang).
knows(mage, rainCall).
knows(warden, sunder).
knows(warden, shieldBash).
knows(warden, taunt).

% === Enemies ===
role(sentry, enemy).
at(sentry, brink).
trait(sentry, machine).
trait(sentry, heavy).
tag(sentry, shielded).
% Its joints seize if soaked and then chilled.
weakness(sentry, chilled, wet, frozen).

role(bramble, enemy).
at(bramble, crypt).
trait(bramble, wooden).
tag(bramble, stealthed).

role(brute, enemy).
at(brute, brink).
rank(brute, boss).
trait(brute, living).
tag(brute, armored).

% === Default kit (a winning pair; F4 strips these and re-adds each pick) ===
knows(player, zap).
knows(player, gust).

% === The encounter ===
clearCrossing :- if(), do(neutralize(sentry), neutralize(bramble), neutralize(brute)).

% === Declared choice space: pick 2 of 8 ===
funChoiceSpace(kit, 2).
funChoice(kit, zap).
funChoice(kit, chainLightning).
funChoice(kit, fireball).
funChoice(kit, iceStorm).
funChoice(kit, frostBolt).
funChoice(kit, tidalWave).
funChoice(kit, gust).
funChoice(kit, charge).
funChoiceFact(zap, knows(player, zap)).
funChoiceFact(chainLightning, knows(player, chainLightning)).
funChoiceFact(fireball, knows(player, fireball)).
funChoiceFact(iceStorm, knows(player, iceStorm)).
funChoiceFact(frostBolt, knows(player, frostBolt)).
funChoiceFact(tidalWave, knows(player, tidalWave)).
funChoiceFact(gust, knows(player, gust)).
funChoiceFact(charge, knows(player, charge)).
funBlocker(sentry).
funBlocker(bramble).
funBlocker(brute).
funBlockerGoal(sentry, neutralize(sentry)).
funBlockerGoal(bramble, neutralize(bramble)).
funBlockerGoal(brute, neutralize(brute)).
funExpect(single_actor_plans, atMost, 0).

goals(clearCrossing).
